{"assets":["/statement-assets/21e8800e1a6207ff4839da155297c3ad756c19de3502444188afc884fdecbaa2.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1242","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Tile Painting"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Ujan has been lazy lately, but now has decided to bring his yard to good shape. First, he decided to paint the path from his house to the gate."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The path consists of $$$n$$$ consecutive tiles, numbered from $$$1$$$ to $$$n$$$. Ujan will paint each tile in some color. He will consider the path "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aesthetic"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if for any two "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"different"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" tiles with numbers $$$i$$$ and $$$j$$$, such that $$$|j - i|$$$ is a divisor of $$$n$$$ greater than $$$1$$$, they have the same color. Formally, the colors of two tiles with numbers $$$i$$$ and $$$j$$$ should be the same if $$$|i-j| \\gt 1$$$ and $$$n \\bmod |i-j| = 0$$$ (where $$$x \\bmod y$$$ is the remainder when dividing $$$x$$$ by $$$y$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Ujan wants to brighten up space. What is the maximum number of different colors that Ujan can use, so that the path is aesthetic?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of input contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\leq n \\leq 10^{12}$$$), the length of the path."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output a single integer, the maximum possible number of colors that the path can be painted in."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample, two colors is the maximum number. Tiles $$$1$$$ and $$$3$$$ should have the same color since $$$4 \\bmod |3-1| = 0$$$. Also, tiles $$$2$$$ and $$$4$$$ should have the same color since $$$4 \\bmod |4-2| = 0$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second sample, all five colors can be used."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/21e8800e1a6207ff4839da155297c3ad756c19de3502444188afc884fdecbaa2.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"1242A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1242/problem/A"}